I go inside the metro station carrying the box of sweets.
Now I know the way around the station very well.
I scan my card and head towards the platform.
The metro arrives in just a few minutes.
The doors open and I step inside.
It is very hot outside, but it is nicely cool inside the coach.
I find an empty seat near the window.
I sit down and watch the city outside.
The train moves very fast and the buildings are left behind quickly.
I think that this evening will be very nice.
I am going to my colleague Priya's house.
I am happy that I am making new friends outside the office.
We will not just talk about work today.
We will get to know each other better.
I hope that she will really like the Kaju Katli.
The metro starts slowing down and the name of the station is heard.
The very next station is mine, so I stand near the door.
I think that I will have a lot of fun tonight.
